1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
ScamSafe supports frontline employees handling suspected scam reports.
Select the bank employee role.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Load a fictional report of a bank-impersonation SMS,
disclosed credentials and an unfamiliar AUD 2,000 debit.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Submit the report for real AI analysis.
AI processing time shortened.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
The AI organises the report and asks three targeted questions.
The employee can review the questions and their purpose.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
The candidate type is suspected phishing.
The explanation connects the suggestion to the reported events.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Reported facts appear in structured fields.
The debit status remains Unknown.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Clarify whether the unfamiliar debit is pending or completed.
Select “Don’t know” when the answer is unavailable.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Unknown information remains visible.
End the remaining questions while retaining the gaps.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Review the bank response guidance and its fictional guideline reference.
The account and payment concern requires human review.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Generate materials from the current case.
AI processing time shortened.

11
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Review the case summary, including reported facts
and unresolved information.

12
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
The explanation for the affected person summarises the report
and sets out suggested next steps.

13
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:13,000
The telecom handover focuses on the suspicious SMS.
The employee reviews the draft before using it.

14
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Edit the summary to flag transaction status for follow-up.
The materials remain drafts until the employee confirms them.

15
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Confirm the reviewed materials.
Confirmation enables copying and downloading.

16
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Download the selected summary as Markdown.
The employee decides the next action through existing organisational processes.
